  "abstract": "This submission reverts the model code to that of Evaluation ID 94 ('Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP with Temporal Conv in Context'), removing the orthogonality regularization that caused severe performance degradation in Evaluation ID 133. This serves as a regression test to re-establish the previous best-performing baseline before re-strategizing further SOTA integration.",
